.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ifg-schema 1  "ifg-schema 0.9.1"
.SH NAME
ifg\-schema \- Describe the commands as JSON for agents (no network or login needed)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg schema\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Describe the commands as JSON for agents (no network or login needed)
.PP
Lists every command with its arguments, whether `\-\-json` is accepted, and whether it reads, writes or deletes. Give a command path to print only that subtree, e.g. `ifg schema pr merge`.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fICOMMAND\fR]
Command path to narrow the output to (default: every command)
.SH VERSION
v0.9.1
